  "2026-10-25T12:24:30.508Z","harness:codex","Dependency proof: publication age exceeds seven days; pnpm replaced only gpt-tokenizer4.0.0 with4.1.0 and the lockfile resolution. All22 linked output/table-row tests pass against the unchanged historical4.0.0/o200k_base baseline, preserving provenance and existing ceilings. Static pipeline passed dependency/advisory, SDK, token and recovery checks before correctly refusing this new item missing explicit confidence; corrected that metadata without changing gate limits and rerunning the failed tracker assertion plus the remaining static suffix. Hosted exact-head review and coverage remain merge requirements."
